title: 'statement-store: configurable statement protocol slots on the v2 DHT path'

doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Hidden `--statement-in-peers` and `--statement-out-peers` set the statement protocol slots on
    the v2 DHT path, 50 each by default. Hidden `--statement-reserved-peers` caps the peers reserved
    to cover the node's topics, unlimited by default.
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    `StatementHandlerPrototype::new` takes `Option<&V2DhtConfig>`, which gains `in_peers`,
    `out_peers` and `reserved_peers`.

crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: major
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: major
- name: staging-node-cli
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
